exports[`money and snapshots > emailOtp plain text matches snapshot 1`] = `
"482913 is your Nantty code

Nantty

VERIFICATION CODE
Here's your code to sign in
===========================

482913
Expires in 10 minutes · Use it once

Enter this code in the Nantty app or on the website. Never share it with anyone — Nantty staff will never ask for it, not even on a call or in chat.

Didn't ask for a code? Someone may have typed your email by mistake. You can ignore this email; nobody can get in without the code.

--
We send security emails to every account owner so you always know what happens to your account. You can't turn these off.
Manage notifications: https://nantty.com/settings/notifications
